			"notes": "Huge release with tons of features, bug fixes and performance improvements. Please report any bugs you find as this is probably the last release before 1.16.\n\n- New commands-- `/seed cracker <ON/OFF>`, `/seed data clear` and `/seed data bits`.\n- Performance improvements with finders looking for features within chunks.\n- Near quadrupled brute-forcing speed by reorganizing the feature list.\n- Added support for end and nether biomes.\n- Added progress updates when looking for seeds.\n- All seeds are now highlighted and can be copied with one click.\n- Added dungeon floor finder.\n\nIn this release, dungeons have been turned off by default (you can re-enable them with `/seed finder type DUNGEON ON`) because of a new experimental feature that was implemented (see #12). With it enabled, it becomes possible to crack the seed without the end dimension."
